course: dictionary
lesson: 14175
title: Molecular: the tiny building blocks
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Molecular is an adjective, and it is a science word. It tells you that something is about molecules. A molecule is a tiny group of atoms joined together, and molecules make up all substances, like water, air and sugar. «Scientists used a molecular model to show how the atoms joined.» Here, molecular describes the model, so the model shows molecules.
explain: You can often guess a science word from the words around it. «The molecular structure of sugar was drawn on the board.» The word structure is about how something is built, so molecular structure means how the molecules are built. Ask yourself: what is being described, and what is it about? Then try your meaning in the sentence and see if it still makes sense.
explain: Molecular also has a second meaning: happening at the level of molecules. «Molecular biology» studies very tiny parts of living things, like DNA and proteins. You do not need to be a scientist to understand it. Break the word into its parts: molecule plus the ending -ar, which means to do with. So molecular means to do with molecules.
fact: A molecule is a tiny group of atoms joined together.
fact: Molecular means to do with molecules.
fact: A water molecule is H₂O: two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.
fact: «Molecular biology» studies things like DNA and proteins.
fact: A molecular model uses balls and sticks to show how molecules are built.
exercise: In «a molecular model», what does molecular tell you? | That the model is for music | *That the model shows molecules | That the model is made of wood | That the model is very large
exercise: What is a molecule? | A kind of loud sound | *A tiny group of atoms joined together | A large animal with fur | A huge rock in space
exercise: Water is H₂O. How many hydrogen atoms are in one water molecule? | One | Three | *Two | None
test: «Molecular gastronomy» is science-style cooking. What does molecular mean in this phrase? | Very old | *To do with molecules, using science ideas | Very hot | Made of metal
test: Which phrase means the study of tiny parts of living things, such as DNA and proteins? | Molecular model | A water molecule | Molecular structure | *Molecular biology
exam: In «the molecular structure of sugar», what does structure tell you about molecular? | *It means how the molecules are built and joined | It means the sugar is in a box | It means the sugar is very sweet | It means the sugar is made of metal
